(Namkyung) Ah...

503
00:21:43.534 --> 00:21:45.400
A new anti-cancer drug?

504
00:21:45.467 --> 00:21:46.773
(Patient 1) Yes

505
00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:50.033
Is it because the anti-cancer drugs are too strong now?

506
00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:52.901
My body is very tired and I have no energy.

507
00:21:52.968 --> 00:21:55.115
I think it's because of the medicine.

508
00:21:55.182 --> 00:21:56.167
Is that right?

509
00:21:56.234 --> 00:21:58.951
Oh, I'm still in my first year.

510
00:21:59.634 --> 00:22:01.534
I'll ask and tell you right away.

511
00:22:01.601 --> 00:22:03.567
(Patient 1) Child, true self

512
00:22:03.634 --> 00:22:05.057
How does our teacher

513
00:22:05.559 --> 00:22:08.200
You don’t know more than the patient.

514
00:22:08.267 --> 00:22:09.362
Ah, indeed

515
00:22:09.429 --> 00:22:10.901
[Nanjing’s embarrassed laughter]

516
00:22:10.968 --> 00:22:13.066
(Jae-il) Oh my, mother

517
00:22:13.133 --> 00:22:14.266
(Patient 1) Oh my

518
00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:15.469
(Japan) Are you having a hard time?

519
00:22:15.536 --> 00:22:16.636
Wow

520
00:22:16.703 --> 00:22:19.033
(Jae-Jae) Physical strength is important when undergoing chemotherapy.

521
00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:21.640
You need to eat well and exercise a lot.

522
00:22:22.668 --> 00:22:24.676
Still, it’s better than when you came 3 weeks ago.

523
00:22:24.743 --> 00:22:27.114
You have a nice face, yeah
[Patient 1 laughs]

524
00:22:27.181 --> 00:22:29.982
I didn't see it and thought I would just leave.
[Patient 1’s light smile]

525
00:22:30.584 --> 00:22:32.051
(Patient 1) Oh, that teacher

526
00:22:32.586 --> 00:22:34.300
Especially

527
00:22:34.367 --> 00:22:37.047
This time, my body is tired and I have no energy.

528
00:22:37.114 --> 00:22:39.500
I'm really dying

529
00:22:39.567 --> 00:22:42.434
Mom, you left a lot of food yesterday too, right?

530
00:22:42.501 --> 00:22:44.699
My mouth is bitter, so what should I do?

531
00:22:44.766 --> 00:22:46.344
I'm sick of hospital food now.

532
00:22:46.411 --> 00:22:47.966
Still

533
00:22:48.033 --> 00:22:50.667
You need to eat a lot and exercise a lot.

534
00:22:50.734 --> 00:22:52.871
That's the best, okay?

535
00:22:52.938 --> 00:22:55.467
Okay, I'll do it, I'll do it

536
00:22:55.534 --> 00:22:57.352
[light music]
(Jae-il) I will come tomorrow and check.

537
00:22:57.419 --> 00:22:58.933
- (Patient 1) Child...
- Have you finished eating or not?

538
00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.300
(Patient 1) I understand, indeed.

539
00:23:00.367 --> 00:23:01.534
[Jae-il and Patient 1’s light laughter]

540
00:23:01.601 --> 00:23:03.382
Then let's fight

541
00:23:03.868 --> 00:23:05.184
thank you

542
00:23:08.956 --> 00:23:10.190
(Patient 1) Oh, right.

543
00:23:10.257 --> 00:23:11.490
[Patient 1 laughs]

544
00:23:14.067 --> 00:23:15.066
(Japan) Hey

545
00:23:15.133 --> 00:23:17.930
If you look like you don't know anything
Patients will really like it

546
00:23:18.665 --> 00:23:20.633
(Namkyung) Oh, I don’t know, so what should I do?

547
00:23:21.535 --> 00:23:25.400
(Japanese) Child
Everyone in the hospital knows anyway.

548
00:23:25.467 --> 00:23:26.572
We're fools

549
00:23:27.734 --> 00:23:30.843
Even the good transport driver Hwang Min-cheol.
We don't believe it

550
00:23:31.434 --> 00:23:34.214
Anyone who is a first-year resident at this hospital is

551
00:23:34.281 --> 00:23:35.495
there is no one

552
00:23:37.367 --> 00:23:40.586
So this is what I said earlier
It's an in-depth episode with a few warm words.

553
00:23:41.968 --> 00:23:44.199
Baby, tell me this, don't you

554
00:23:45.834 --> 00:23:47.993
Let me know, I'll listen.

555
00:23:48.634 --> 00:23:50.700
Eat well and exercise a lot

556
00:23:50.767 --> 00:23:51.664
What?

557
00:23:52.132 --> 00:23:54.133
(Jaeil) If you’re not sure, just say this

558
00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.435
Eat well and exercise a lot

559
00:23:58.138 --> 00:23:59.100
Oh, is that wrong?

560
00:23:59.167 --> 00:24:01.540
That’s right, eat well and exercise a lot.

561
00:24:01.607 --> 00:24:03.176
That's the shortcut to health

562
00:24:03.243 --> 00:24:05.654
Ah, I listened seriously for no reason.

563
00:24:06.593 --> 00:24:07.681
You said something that didn't matter

564
00:24:07.748 --> 00:24:09.449
(Patient 2) Huh? teacher

565
00:24:09.516 --> 00:24:11.183
(Jaeil) No, hello?

566
00:24:12.366 --> 00:24:13.867
How is the pain?

567
00:24:13.934 --> 00:24:15.634
It's still a bit uncomfortable

568
00:24:15.701 --> 00:24:17.100
It's not getting better quickly?

569
00:24:17.167 --> 00:24:19.534
Ah, eat well now.

570
00:24:19.601 --> 00:24:21.327
You need to exercise a lot

571
00:24:21.834 --> 00:24:23.300
Did you exercise a lot today?

572
00:24:23.367 --> 00:24:24.500
I didn't do much

573
00:24:24.567 --> 00:24:27.300
(Jaeil) Oh, that doesn’t work.

574
00:24:27.367 --> 00:24:28.767
You have to do it consistently

575
00:24:28.834 --> 00:24:29.834
Take a walk with me

576
00:24:29.901 --> 00:24:30.901
[Patient 2 laughs]

577
00:24:30.968 --> 00:24:32.671
That's fine then

578
00:24:32.738 --> 00:24:34.439
I also went on a date with my teacher.

579
00:24:34.506 --> 00:24:35.700
[Jae-il and Patient 2’s laughter]

580
00:24:35.767 --> 00:24:37.042
Just go to the annex over there.

581
00:24:37.109 --> 00:24:38.100
[humorous music]
(Patient 2) Yes

582
00:24:38.167 --> 00:24:39.745
(Jae-il) Even when I’m not there
You need to exercise a lot

583
00:24:39.812 --> 00:24:40.779
[Patient 2 laughs]

584
00:24:40.846 --> 00:24:42.901
(Patient 2) Oh, yes, I understand.

585
00:24:42.968 --> 00:24:44.451
(Jae-il) I will check it every day.

586
00:24:44.518 --> 00:24:45.751
[Patient 2 laughs]

587
00:24:49.754 --> 00:24:51.123
(Sunmi) Hey, mom
[Sunmi’s mock sobbing sound]

588
00:24:51.190 --> 00:24:52.033
(Sunmi) Huh?

589
00:24:52.100 --> 00:24:53.359
My hands and feet are fine

590
00:24:53.968 --> 00:24:56.996
(Sunmi’s name) It’s because my mom wants to do it.
Because my mom wants to do it

591
00:24:58.565 --> 00:24:59.763
Ah, indeed

592
00:25:00.501 --> 00:25:02.033
bed by the window

593
00:25:02.100 --> 00:25:05.105
I heard you can fly tomorrow, so just be patient

594
00:25:05.172 --> 00:25:06.305
(Sunmi) Is it nice here?

595
00:25:06.773 --> 00:25:08.141
It's easy to go out into the hallway

596
00:25:08.208 --> 00:25:10.400
What is good?

597
00:25:10.467 --> 00:25:11.467
It's a doorway room.

598
00:25:11.534 --> 00:25:13.667
What kind of doorway is this?

599
00:25:13.734 --> 00:25:15.767
It's close to the nurses and teachers.

600
00:25:15.834 --> 00:25:17.272
The bathroom is right in front too.

601
00:25:19.520 --> 00:25:21.053
My daughter is so kind

602
00:25:23.356 --> 00:25:26.100
(Sunmi) So kind
Why do I only think good things...
[Sunmi sighs]

603
00:25:26.167 --> 00:25:27.693
(Sunmi) It’s starting again, again

604
00:25:28.262 --> 00:25:30.062
[Sunmi’s mock sobbing sound]
I'll be swept away

605
00:25:31.532 --> 00:25:33.166
- (Lee Young) Hello
- (Sunmi) Hello

606
00:25:33.233 --> 00:25:34.296
(Lee Young) Hello

607
00:25:34.801 --> 00:25:36.300
There's nothing uncomfortable, right?

608
00:25:36.367 --> 00:25:37.567
yes, none

609
00:25:37.634 --> 00:25:38.637
It's all good

610
00:25:39.406 --> 00:25:42.142
Uh, I think the surgery will be the day after tomorrow afternoon.

611
00:25:42.209 --> 00:25:43.834
Uh, it's the last time of the day.

612
00:25:43.901 --> 00:25:46.333
If the previous surgery is delayed or an emergency occurs,

613
00:25:46.400 --> 00:25:47.917
It may be later

614
00:25:47.984 --> 00:25:51.518
Oh, I'm starving today because I'm having a test.

615
00:25:51.585 --> 00:25:55.066
I will be fasting until late on the day of surgery.

616
00:25:55.133 --> 00:25:57.289
Then he doesn't have stamina.

617
00:25:57.900 --> 00:26:01.133
(Sunmi) Can’t I do it on the morning of the surgery?

618
00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:03.922
There are other surgeries ahead.

619
00:26:03.989 --> 00:26:07.334
(Lee Young) Otherwise
I have to postpone the date. Should I postpone it?

620
00:26:07.401 --> 00:26:08.434
[Sunmi mock sigh]

621
00:26:08.501 --> 00:26:10.143
(Sunmi) No, I’ll just do it.

622
00:26:10.210 --> 00:26:11.670
Please stick to your original schedule.

623
00:26:11.737 --> 00:26:12.771
(Lee Young) Ah, yes

624
00:26:13.400 --> 00:26:15.033
(Sunmi) Mom, it’s okay because I’m young.

625
00:26:15.100 --> 00:26:17.966
Please mom, stop fasting and eat something.

626
00:26:18.033 --> 00:26:19.778
Teacher, please say something.

627
00:26:22.167 --> 00:26:25.150
Mom, you need to eat to be healthy.

628
00:26:25.886 --> 00:26:26.870
Be sure to eat it

629
00:26:27.968 --> 00:26:29.355
I'll take care of it.

630
00:26:30.601 --> 00:26:32.192
(Sunmi) Ah, teacher.

631
00:26:32.259 --> 00:26:34.600
How long does the surgery take?

632
00:26:34.667 --> 00:26:38.000
Oh, just the hysterectomy takes an hour and a half.

633
00:26:38.067 --> 00:26:39.599
If ovarian metastasis is confirmed

634
00:26:39.666 --> 00:26:41.967
It will take up to 3 hours

635
00:26:42.034 --> 00:26:44.734
I also had an MRI done earlier.

636
00:26:44.801 --> 00:26:47.072
Can’t you really see that it has metastasized?

637
00:26:47.667 --> 00:26:50.476
Yeah, I can't really tell from that.

638
00:26:51.901 --> 00:26:55.781
No, it's still a major surgery to open the stomach.

639
00:26:56.483 --> 00:26:58.718
Well, I don't know how many hours

640
00:26:58.785 --> 00:27:01.200
I don't even know how much it costs

641
00:27:01.267 --> 00:27:02.788
It doesn't make sense.

642
00:27:03.524 --> 00:27:07.694
But there are many cases like that with wives.

643
00:27:07.761 --> 00:27:08.994
[Sunmi mock sigh]

644
00:27:09.534 --> 00:27:10.596
(Sunmi) What’s going on?

645
00:27:11.158 --> 00:27:13.498
(Sunmi) Mom, it could be good.

646
00:27:13.565 --> 00:27:15.100
Huh? Right, teacher?

647
00:27:15.167 --> 00:27:16.502
The ovaries might be okay, right?

648
00:27:17.871 --> 00:27:18.933
(Lee Young) Uh...

649
00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:22.174
I don't have anything to say right now.

650
00:27:22.776 --> 00:27:25.077
I'll have to have surgery to find out.

651
00:27:25.144 --> 00:27:26.380
[Sunmi mocks crying]

652
00:27:28.701 --> 00:27:31.083
The teacher made my mom cry again.

653
00:27:31.700 --> 00:27:33.086
[Sunmi’s mock sobbing sound]

654
00:27:33.153 --> 00:27:35.088
(Sunmi) Ms. Yang, stop crying.

655
00:27:35.155 --> 00:27:36.321
- (Sunmi) Okay
- (Sunmi) Huh?

656
00:27:38.014 --> 00:27:41.060
(Okim) Oh my, that’s right
I don't know that

657
00:27:41.734 --> 00:27:43.333
The day after tomorrow, huh?

658
00:27:43.400 --> 00:27:45.966
If you just let me be discharged the day after tomorrow, I'll be fine.

659
00:27:46.033 --> 00:27:48.500
Grandma, I don't know that yet.

660
00:27:48.567 --> 00:27:49.700
(Nanjing) I don’t know now

661
00:27:49.767 --> 00:27:52.105
But first, you have to redo the urine line.

662
00:27:52.172 --> 00:27:53.640
The residual urine volume is over 400.

663
00:27:53.707 --> 00:27:55.274
4, 400?

664
00:27:55.901 --> 00:27:59.066
(Okim) Oh, what is that?
Is it over 4 million won?

665
00:27:59.133 --> 00:28:01.648
No, it's urine left in the bladder.

666
00:28:01.715 --> 00:28:04.600
This urine has to come out.
It's not coming out

667
00:28:04.667 --> 00:28:07.019
(Okim) Ome, how did you see it?

668
00:28:07.592 --> 00:28:11.540
[Surprisingly] Oh my gosh
I didn't go out and flush the water.

669
00:28:12.267 --> 00:28:13.560
no

670
00:28:13.627 --> 00:28:14.526
(Namkyung) Uh...

671
00:28:16.228 --> 00:28:18.167
I'll put the urine strip back on later.

672
00:28:18.234 --> 00:28:22.333
I'll check the residual urine volume again tomorrow.
Only when that decreases can you be discharged.

673
00:28:22.400 --> 00:28:23.435
Oh my, what happened?

674
00:28:24.205 --> 00:28:26.807
I have a wedding in 3 days.

675
00:28:26.874 --> 00:28:29.009
(Okim) Ome, what should I do, huh?

676
00:28:29.076 --> 00:28:32.279
Oh my, I’m going to cheat on you before Jungheon’s day.

677
00:28:32.346 --> 00:28:34.847
My family doesn't know I had surgery.

678
00:28:35.434 --> 00:28:37.267
Oh my, how should I use it?

679
00:28:37.334 --> 00:28:39.820
Well, no blackmail, huh?

680
00:28:39.887 --> 00:28:41.973
I had to go to the wedding that day.

681
00:28:42.767 --> 00:28:45.933
Young Master, is there no better way?

682
00:28:46.000 --> 00:28:48.444
I really want to send it to you too

683
00:28:49.296 --> 00:28:51.864
However, if there is a lot of residual urine, you cannot be discharged.

684
00:28:53.100 --> 00:28:55.060
Oh my, my goodness

685
00:28:55.127 --> 00:28:57.736
Why doesn't urine come out when you sweat?

686
00:28:57.803 --> 00:28:58.637
[Nankyung’s embarrassed groan]

687
00:28:58.704 --> 00:29:01.567
(Ok Im) Then, give me some dick medicine, eh?

688
00:29:01.634 --> 00:29:04.709
Whatever it is, please give me some treatment.

689
00:29:04.776 --> 00:29:06.400
I'll be discharged from the hospital in 3 days.

690
00:29:06.467 --> 00:29:07.714
First, you have to watch.

691
00:29:07.781 --> 00:29:08.828
(Okim) What pee!

692
00:29:09.667 --> 00:29:12.385
Omi, are we seeing each other again?

693
00:29:12.452 --> 00:29:14.983
It's not urine, it's residual urine.

694
00:29:19.734 --> 00:29:20.692
grandmother

695
00:29:22.496 --> 00:29:23.891
You don’t eat well, do you?

696
00:29:24.434 --> 00:29:25.801
[humorous music]

697
00:29:25.868 --> 00:29:27.299
(Okim) Dick, that’s...

698
00:29:28.934 --> 00:29:30.434
Oh, I gave it to you as a gift, but you kept it?

699
00:29:30.501 --> 00:29:31.801
(Namkyung) Ah, somehow!

700
00:29:31.868 --> 00:29:35.267
Grandma, eat well and drink a lot of water.

701
00:29:35.334 --> 00:29:38.612
[Clapping hands]
In particular, you need to exercise a lot.

702
00:29:38.679 --> 00:29:40.600
Only then can you be discharged.

703
00:29:40.667 --> 00:29:42.133
(Okim) Oh my gosh, it’s true

704
00:29:42.200 --> 00:29:44.183
I don't know it, huh?

705
00:29:44.818 --> 00:29:46.703
It hurts because my stomach was cut open.

706
00:29:46.770 --> 00:29:48.453
This thing is cold too

707
00:29:49.067 --> 00:29:53.059
The more
You need to eat well and exercise a lot.

708
00:29:53.126 --> 00:29:54.259
[Okim clears his throat]

709
00:29:54.862 --> 00:29:55.966
(Ok Im) Draw it

710
00:29:56.033 --> 00:29:57.029
Handang crab

711
00:29:57.701 --> 00:29:58.999
Go out from today

712
00:29:59.066 --> 00:30:03.402
No, I'll do it right away, don't worry.

713
00:30:03.968 --> 00:30:04.970
yes

714
00:30:08.141 --> 00:30:09.374
(Nankyung) Is it true?

715
00:30:10.143 --> 00:30:13.021
I wasn't Eom Jae-il
I almost stayed up all night with that old lady.

716
00:30:13.701 --> 00:30:15.167
Hey, it's true

717
00:30:15.234 --> 00:30:16.415
It's completely effective

718
00:30:17.518 --> 00:30:21.400
(Japan) Book report and thesis report
What are you doing just filling your head?

719
00:30:21.467 --> 00:30:23.522
Studying is not everything in practice

720
00:30:24.367 --> 00:30:27.259
(Sabi) I want to use it too, but I don’t have the chance.

721
00:30:27.326 --> 00:30:28.509
[Knocking sound]
[Sound of door opening]

722
00:30:30.930 --> 00:30:31.830
(together) hello

723
00:30:31.897 --> 00:30:33.233
(Nanjing) Hello

724
00:30:33.300 --> 00:30:35.700
(Dowon) Oh, you guys have become really close by now?

725
00:30:35.767 --> 00:30:37.769
We leave work together
[Nankyung’s light smile]

726
00:30:39.061 --> 00:30:41.206
- Where are the four of you going?
- (Together) Home.

727
00:30:42.676 --> 00:30:44.476
Yes, ah, there was a house.

728
00:30:47.214 --> 00:30:48.213
Go, then

729
00:30:48.916 --> 00:30:50.349
(Together) Goodbye

730
00:30:51.634 --> 00:30:52.651
You guys...

731
00:30:53.921 --> 00:30:55.066
Aren’t you hungry?

732
00:30:55.133 --> 00:30:56.133
(Sabi) Huh?

733
00:30:56.200 --> 00:30:57.066
(Nanjing) Rice?

734
00:30:57.133 --> 00:30:58.957
Um, shall we have dinner together?

735
00:31:02.062 --> 00:31:03.124
Are you buying it for me?

736
00:31:04.898 --> 00:31:06.598
[Jaeil’s light smile]
[lively music]

737
00:31:20.414 --> 00:31:22.735
I’m thankful that Teacher Oh I-young stayed.

738
00:31:23.351 --> 00:31:24.383
(Dowon) Eat quickly

739
00:31:26.386 --> 00:31:27.921
Thank you so much

740
00:31:27.988 --> 00:31:30.389
Oh, who's left?
If you ask me to eat on the way home from work,

741
00:31:31.755 --> 00:31:33.560
I made a big mistake

742
00:31:33.627 --> 00:31:35.560
Oh, really, I had no idea.

743
00:31:36.633 --> 00:31:38.868
(Dowon) Still, the kids
Don't lie, be honest

744
00:31:38.935 --> 00:31:40.398
I'm glad you asked me to buy it next time

745
00:31:40.465 --> 00:31:42.133
I’m not sorry and the kids aren’t sorry either.

746
00:31:42.200 --> 00:31:43.334
[laughter]

747
00:31:43.401 --> 00:31:44.871
Don’t you know MZ?

748
00:31:44.938 --> 00:31:46.405
Why don’t you know, I’m MZ too

749
00:31:46.907 --> 00:31:48.012
What did you say

750
00:31:52.846 --> 00:31:54.358
But why don’t you get off work?

751
00:31:55.256 --> 00:31:56.388
I need to watch the surgery video

752
00:31:57.315 --> 00:31:58.250
(Lee Young) Yes

753
00:32:01.221 --> 00:32:02.220
Why don't you go?

754
00:32:03.891 --> 00:32:05.157
Ah, let's eat...

755
00:32:06.593 --> 00:32:08.393
I was on my way home from work, right?

756
00:32:09.162 --> 00:32:10.274
(Dowon) That’s right, sorry.

757
00:32:16.067 --> 00:32:17.035
[Dowon’s sigh]

