I don't even have the right to cry

1066
00:46:09.436 --> 00:46:10.468
[light laughter]

1067
00:46:11.805 --> 00:46:14.576
Just looking at him makes me want to cry

1068
00:46:21.982 --> 00:46:23.014
[Sunmi’s wife’s light laughter]

1069
00:46:25.668 --> 00:46:27.084
