The day when the person called mom was fake

1072
00:46:34.768 --> 00:46:36.360
I'm crying out loud

1073
00:46:37.301 --> 00:46:39.901
What I haven't been able to take care of for you all this time

1074
00:46:39.968 --> 00:46:41.468
I'm going to do it all for you

1075
00:46:41.535 --> 00:46:43.170
[Calm music - continued]

1076
00:46:43.237 --> 00:46:45.736
From now on, stick close to my side

1077
00:46:47.167 --> 00:46:50.208
I will never hurt alone again

1078
