00:55:21.267 --> 00:55:22.389
What are you talking about?

1259
00:55:22.456 --> 00:55:23.554
Anything to talk about

1260
00:55:24.258 --> 00:55:25.756
I can't do that.

1261
00:55:26.260 --> 00:55:28.225
[Elevator arrival sound]

1262
00:55:31.798 --> 00:55:32.896
[Elevator button sound]

1263
00:55:35.035 --> 00:55:36.266
(Japan) Use it, in those times

1264
00:55:39.434 --> 00:55:42.337
(Sunmi’s mother) [Sniffling] Mom, here
Because I will wait

1265
00:55:42.404 --> 00:55:44.842
Don't worry about anything, just sleep well.

1266
00:55:46.747 --> 00:55:47.781
[Sunmi and Sunmi mock laughter]
[Sorrowful music]

1267
00:55:47.848 --> 00:55:50.080
My good and smart daughter

1268
00:55:51.234 --> 00:55:52.403
[Sunmi’s whimpering sound]

1269
00:55:52.470 --> 00:55:54.752
Everything will be fine, don't worry

1270
00:55:55.571 --> 00:55:56.836
I only trust my mom

1271
00:55:56.903 --> 00:55:58.303
(Sunmi) Okay

1272
00:55:58.370 --> 00:55:59.769
I'm not worried

1273
00:55:59.836 --> 00:56:01.625
The teachers will take care of it.

1274
00:56:03.197 --> 00:56:06.703
And if you only perform surgery on the uterus, it takes an hour and a half.

1275
00:56:06.770 --> 00:56:09.337
Even ovarian surgery can be done in 3 hours.

1276
00:56:09.404 --> 00:56:10.896
Soon, soon

1277
00:56:11.572 --> 00:56:12.703
1 hour and a half

1278
00:56:14.504 --> 00:56:16.373
Finishes in 1 and a half hours

1279
00:56:17.170 --> 00:56:18.041
It will happen

1280
00:56:21.204 --> 00:56:22.479
Right, teacher?

1281
00:56:23.584 --> 00:56:25.411
Ah... yes

1282
00:56:26.836 --> 00:56:28.152
I'll have a good surgery

1283
00:56:28.903 --> 00:56:31.337
Mom, don't cry outside, okay?

1284
00:56:31.404 --> 00:56:33.056
(Sunmi’s name) Mom, don’t cry

1285
00:56:33.571 --> 00:56:35.092
Why is mom crying?

1286
00:56:35.903 --> 00:56:38.061
Everything will be fine after surgery.

1287
00:56:41.370 --> 00:56:43.237
Please take care, teacher.

1288
00:56:43.304 --> 00:56:46.103
(Lee Young) Okay, let’s go in now.

1289
00:56:47.608 --> 00:56:48.605
[pass tag sound]

1290
00:56:50.577 --> 00:56:51.708
(Sunmi) I’ll go and come back

1291
00:56:54.915 --> 00:56:56.013
[Sunmi’s light smile]

1292
00:57:01.288 --> 00:57:02.553
[Sunmi’s trembling breathing]

1293
00:57:04.396 --> 00:57:05.756
(Nurse 2) What is your name?

1294
00:57:07.027 --> 00:57:08.525
When did you start fasting?

1295
00:57:19.306 --> 00:57:21.471
(Nurse 3) Before going in
Let me check a few things

1296
00:57:21.975 --> 00:57:23.212
What is your name?

1297
00:57:24.178 --> 00:57:25.842
How much longer can I wait?

1298
00:57:25.909 --> 00:57:29.046
(Lee Young) I just need to check personal information.
I'll be in soon

1299
00:57:32.886 --> 00:57:35.052
[Newborn baby cries]

1300
00:57:38.458 --> 00:57:39.790
(Youngchan) Father, what about me?

1301
00:57:41.728 --> 00:57:42.852
my life

1302
00:57:44.803 --> 00:57:46.530
I can dedicate it to my child

1303
00:57:47.264 --> 00:57:49.499
Oh, you can also dedicate it to Gyeongju

1304
00:57:50.304 --> 00:57:51.404
[Sound of automatic door opening]

1305
00:57:51.471 --> 00:57:52.469
[Gyeongjubu’s laughter]

1306
00:57:54.070 --> 00:57:55.970
(Nurse 4) Hwang Gyeong-ju, baby’s guardian

1307
00:57:56.037 --> 00:57:57.441
(Youngchan) Me, I am the father.

1308
00:58:01.281 --> 00:58:03.734
[Sound of automatic door opening and closing]

1309
00:58:03.801 --> 00:58:05.082
[Newborn baby cries]

1310
00:58:05.752 --> 00:58:06.634
[Gyeongjubu’s sigh]

1311
00:58:06.701 --> 00:58:09.219
[Newborn baby cries]

1312
00:58:11.003 --> 00:58:14.060
Where have you been, father?
Are you not in the hospital room during the day?

1313
00:58:14.127 --> 00:58:15.726
(Gyeongjubu) Oh, yeah, wait a minute.

1314
00:58:20.400 --> 00:58:21.362
So...

1315
00:58:22.302 --> 00:58:23.265
Congratulations

1316
00:58:26.306 --> 00:58:27.774
The baby is really pretty

1317
00:58:28.637 --> 00:58:30.374
It looks just like your mother, right?

1318
00:58:32.579 --> 00:58:35.012
(Sabi) My boyfriend likes it a lot too.

1319
00:58:35.671 --> 00:58:38.215
I think you're already being a fool.

1320
00:58:40.803 --> 00:58:42.386
Really congratulations, father.

1321
00:58:51.237 --> 00:58:52.195
(Gyeongju Department) I

1322
00:58:52.937 --> 00:58:54.932
It should be celebrated, right?

1323
00:58:56.870 --> 00:58:57.935
yes?

1324
00:58:59.467 --> 00:59:01.171
[Calm music]

1325
00:59:01.238 --> 00:59:04.044
In one day
Should I be happy that I became a grandfather?

1326
00:59:08.115 --> 00:59:10.814
Oh, for being born healthy
I know I’m thankful too

1327
00:59:12.370 --> 00:59:13.917
I know that I am responsible

1328
00:59:15.455 --> 00:59:17.287
What a precious life

1329
00:59:18.358 --> 00:59:20.078
I know it all too

1330
00:59:23.997 --> 00:59:27.058
That baby looks just like my daughter

1331
00:59:29.275 --> 00:59:31.101
That innocent baby

1332
00:59:34.270 --> 00:59:35.405
(Gyeongju Club) For me,

1333
00:59:39.046 --> 00:59:42.112
It's like an angel came to grab my daughter's ankle.

1334
01:00:05.138 --> 01:00:06.937
(Lee Young) There are a lot of surgeries, right?

1335
01:00:08.175 --> 01:00:10.007
There are so many people getting surgery.

1336
01:00:10.703 --> 01:00:12.036
Than Sunmi

1337
01:00:12.103 --> 01:00:13.647
Because there are many worse people

1338
01:00:13.714 --> 01:00:15.746
(Sunmi) Oh, fellow soldier?

1339
01:00:18.181 --> 01:00:19.052
(Lee Young) Yes?

1340
01:00:19.119 --> 01:00:21.354
If it's something like that, put it in.

1341
01:00:21.421 --> 01:00:22.919
I've heard it too much

1342
01:00:23.790 --> 01:00:25.203
(Sunmi) What is comradeship?

1343
01:00:25.270 --> 01:00:26.890
I'm the youngest here

1344
01:00:27.703 --> 01:00:29.159
I have no luck

1345
01:00:31.999 --> 01:00:33.636
(Lee Young) While Sunmi was undergoing surgery

1346
01:00:33.703 --> 01:00:35.499
Because I will always be by your side

1347
01:00:36.703 --> 01:00:38.972
Take it easy

1348
01:00:39.039 --> 01:00:40.904
Why are you acting like a teacher?

1349
01:00:42.176 --> 01:00:44.347
Since none of those words can comfort me, I just

1350
01:00:45.703 --> 01:00:47.144
Can't you just keep doing what you're doing?

1351
01:00:48.836 --> 01:00:50.647
Who ordered that? Right?

1352
01:00:51.214 --> 01:00:52.182
(Lee Young) Yes

1353
01:00:52.986 --> 01:00:55.570
My classmate is Eom Jae-il.

1354
01:00:55.637 --> 01:00:57.454
[Sunmi’s laughter]

1355
01:01:15.609 --> 01:01:17.040
[Medical device operation sound]

1356
01:01:32.860 --> 01:01:33.790
[Sunmi’s trembling breathing]

1357
01:01:35.861 --> 01:01:36.860
(Sunmi) Ah...

1358
01:01:41.802 --> 01:01:42.700
Why are you like this?

1359
01:01:42.767 --> 01:01:43.970
[Sunmi’s trembling breathing]

1360
01:01:44.037 --> 01:01:46.036
Oh, I'm really fine.

1361
01:01:46.903 --> 01:01:48.405
[Sunmi’s crying sound]

1362
01:01:50.310 --> 01:01:53.276
[Sunmi’s sobbing]

1363
01:01:55.604 --> 01:01:57.203
Oh, I'm sorry, teacher.

1364
01:01:57.270 --> 01:01:59.216
[Sunmi’s crying]
[sad music]

1365
01:02:01.855 --> 01:02:03.954
Oh, sorry.
[Sunmi’s crying]

1366
01:02:17.604 --> 01:02:19.169
- (Sanghyun) Patient
- (Lee Young) Teacher

1367
01:02:19.236 --> 01:02:20.370
[Sunmi’s crying]

1368
01:02:20.437 --> 01:02:21.872
I have a favor to ask you.

1369
01:02:35.189 --> 01:02:36.319
[Gyeongju groans in pain]

1370
01:02:37.491 --> 01:02:38.855
[Sound of door opening]

1371
01:02:40.067 --> 01:02:41.636
[Sound of door closing]
[Gyeongju groans in pain]

1372
01:02:41.703 --> 01:02:43.504
(Youngchan) Why, where does it hurt?

1373
01:02:43.571 --> 01:02:44.694
(Gyeongju) No, it’s okay

1374
01:02:45.836 --> 01:02:46.763
That...

1375
01:02:48.537 --> 01:02:49.903
Did you have a good time?

1376
01:02:49.970 --> 01:02:51.134
Oh, my mom?

1377
01:02:51.738 --> 01:02:52.870
Oh, they say they'll come back tomorrow

1378
01:02:55.770 --> 01:02:57.274
(Youngchan) Baby clothes and lobster towels

1379
01:02:57.937 --> 01:02:59.142
They said they would need it

1380
01:02:59.209 --> 01:03:01.734
Oh, tell them thank you

1381
01:03:01.801 --> 01:03:02.812
(Youngchan) Yes

1382
01:03:06.887 --> 01:03:08.068
Honey, where does it hurt?

1383
01:03:09.671 --> 01:03:11.721
Does it hurt a lot? Should I call the doctor?

1384
01:03:14.361 --> 01:03:15.616
(Gyeongju) Ah...

1385
01:03:17.170 --> 01:03:19.429
Oh no
[Sound of door opening]

1386
01:03:20.736 --> 01:03:21.998
[Sound of door closing]

1387
01:03:22.469 --> 01:03:23.533
(Sabi) Hello

1388
01:03:24.338 --> 01:03:25.468
(Youngchan) Hello

1389
01:03:29.243 --> 01:03:30.333
This

1390
01:03:30.400 --> 01:03:32.400
[Calm music]

1391
01:03:35.215 --> 01:03:36.546
[Gyeongju’s comfortable breathing]

1392
01:03:37.518 --> 01:03:39.286
I think I'll buy it, teacher.

1393
01:03:39.353 --> 01:03:40.433
There's more

1394
01:03:48.170 --> 01:03:51.428
I really think I will buy it, thank you

1395
01:03:54.468 --> 01:03:56.736
My father threw it in the trash can.

1396
01:03:56.803 --> 01:03:58.836
(Sabi) I was going to follow you and give it back to you.

1397
01:03:58.903 --> 01:04:01.671
Looking at the contents
Given the context, it seems like it's from a mother.

1398
01:04:14.821 --> 01:04:16.987
(Gyeongju Department) ‘Discharged from hospital’
'I asked the mothers'

1399
01:04:17.970 --> 01:04:19.189
‘They said we need something like this’

1400
01:04:20.194 --> 01:04:22.158
[Nostalgic music]
‘If you need anything more’

1401
01:04:22.225 --> 01:04:23.270
'Contact me'
[Gyeongju’s Cry]

1402
01:04:56.402 --> 01:04:57.294
(Youngchan) Ah

1403
01:04:59.380 --> 01:05:00.297
here

1404
01:05:02.170 --> 01:05:03.203
Are you okay?

1405
01:05:03.270 --> 01:05:04.434
[Gyeongju’s Cry]

1406
01:05:04.501 --> 01:05:05.669
Did it hurt a lot?

1407
01:05:06.703 --> 01:05:08.573
It's okay, it's okay

1408
01:05:11.645 --> 01:05:13.543
[Gyeongju’s Cry]

1409
01:05:16.950 --> 01:05:18.114
[Sunmi’s crying]

1410
01:05:27.870 --> 01:05:29.592
(Sanghyeon) It’s 7:20

1411
01:05:32.466 --> 01:05:34.070
(Lee Young) Please give me 10 more minutes.

1412
01:05:34.137 --> 01:05:35.131
thank you

1413
01:05:36.637 --> 01:05:37.966
(Sanghyun) Oh, we’re okay.

1414
01:05:38.537 --> 01:05:40.036
Teacher Oh I-young, are you okay?

1415
01:05:40.103 --> 01:05:42.403
Even if I prepare from now on, it will take 30 more minutes.

1416
01:05:42.470 --> 01:05:43.877
(Bori) Professor Jo Jun-mo

1417
01:05:43.944 --> 01:05:46.217
You're not the type of person who understands this.

1418
01:05:46.976 --> 01:05:49.015
I'm sure you'll scream a lot again.

1419
01:05:49.082 --> 01:05:51.514
(Lee Young) I will tell the professor.

1420
01:05:54.454 --> 01:05:56.353
[Call connection tone]

1421
01:06:01.195 --> 01:06:03.663
Professor, surgery on patient Geum Seon-mi.

1422
01:06:03.730 --> 01:06:05.428
(Junmo) Uh, I’ll arrive in exactly 5 minutes.

1423
01:06:05.968 --> 01:06:07.333
The surgery will start right away.

1424
01:06:07.400 --> 01:06:09.866
(Lee Young) Oh, that’s right, I don’t think that will work.

1425
01:06:10.836 --> 01:06:12.268
Why, what's the problem?

1426
01:06:12.903 --> 01:06:13.837
(Lee Young) It’s me.

1427
01:06:14.337 --> 01:06:15.171
Uh...

1428
01:06:15.805 --> 01:06:18.375
I skipped one wrap in the morning.

1429
01:06:19.870 --> 01:06:21.678
(Sanghyeon) Abgar, Abgar, Abgar

1430
01:06:22.170 --> 01:06:23.570
(Lee Young) ABGA

1431
01:06:23.637 --> 01:06:24.803
(Junmo) You left out Abgar?

1432
01:06:24.870 --> 01:06:25.715
(Lee Young) Yes

1433
01:06:25.782 --> 01:06:29.237
That's right now in the anesthesiology department.
ABGA is in progress as an emergency.

1434
01:06:29.304 --> 01:06:30.470
A little time...

1435
01:06:30.537 --> 01:06:31.858
(Junmo) Hey!

1436
01:06:31.925 --> 01:06:34.023
what the hell are you
Are you going to get your mind back to work, huh?

1437
01:06:34.504 --> 01:06:36.058
I have a conference meeting today!

1438
01:06:36.125 --> 01:06:39.203
I told you there was no delay
How many times, how many times do you say it?

1439
01:06:39.270 --> 01:06:40.803
Oh, please don't be late this time.

1440
01:06:40.870 --> 01:06:42.932
I made a request like that.

1441
01:06:43.737 --> 01:06:46.270
Wow! Seriously, what on earth are you doing?

1442
01:06:46.337 --> 01:06:48.604
What on earth is this guy doing!

1443
01:06:48.671 --> 01:06:51.036
(Lee Young) I’m really sorry
I will never let something like this happen again.

1444
01:06:51.103 --> 01:06:52.342
(Junmo) Hey, you idiot!

1445
01:06:53.237 --> 01:06:55.237
(Lee Young) Yes, that’s right, I’m stupid.
sorry

1446
01:06:55.304 --> 01:06:56.146
[Call end sound]

1447
01:07:00.003 --> 01:07:01.017
[Lee Young sighs]

1448
01:07:05.000 --> 01:07:06.413
[Medical device operation sound]

1449
01:07:06.480 --> 01:07:07.678
thank you

1450
01:07:10.067 --> 01:07:11.333
[Calm music]
[Sunmi’s whimpering sound]

1451
01:07:11.400 --> 01:07:12.662
(Sanghyun) Let’s start anesthesia.

1452
01:07:26.313 --> 01:07:28.313
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1453
01:07:41.228 --> 01:07:42.292
[Sunmi sighs nervously]

1454
01:07:46.367 --> 01:07:48.231
[Medical device operation sound]
[ECG meter beeping sound]

1455
01:07:50.504 --> 01:07:52.049
(Junmo) Oh Iyoung, aren’t you concentrating?

1456
01:07:53.040 --> 01:07:55.872
I'm late because of you, huh?
Why do you keep looking at your watch?

1457
01:07:56.643 --> 01:07:57.707
(Lee Young) I’m sorry

1458
01:08:01.882 --> 01:08:03.313
(Junmo) It’s a little late today

1459
01:08:07.306 --> 01:08:09.222
(Lee Young) It’s time to come

1460
01:08:09.289 --> 01:08:10.323
(Announcement) This is the Department of Pathology.

1461
01:08:10.390 --> 01:08:12.834
This is the surgery for patient Geum Seon-mi in room 10, right?

1462
01:08:12.901 --> 01:08:14.194
(Junmo) Yes, that’s right

1463
01:08:14.261 --> 01:08:16.429
(Announcement) The organization that sent you
Are you ovarian?

1464
01:08:16.496 --> 01:08:17.597
(Junmo) Yes

1465
01:08:17.664 --> 01:08:19.762
(Announcement) First of all,
In the section...

1466
01:08:23.537 --> 01:08:24.601
[Sunmi’s mock sobbing sound]

1467
01:08:30.757 --> 01:08:33.780
(Junmo) I’ll tell you well about the results.
Take care of your facial expressions so you don't get surprised...

1468
01:08:33.847 --> 01:08:35.445
[Sound of automatic door opening]
[Sound of running footsteps]

1469
01:08:38.631 --> 01:08:39.753
[Junmo’s sigh]

1470
01:08:39.820 --> 01:08:41.768
If only I had prepared for surgery at that speed.

1471
01:08:53.501 --> 01:08:55.549
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST-Continued]

1472
01:08:59.139 --> 01:09:00.503
[Lee Young’s heavy breathing]

1473
01:09:05.608 --> 01:09:07.243
(Sunmi) Thank you teacher

1474
01:09:08.315 --> 01:09:11.014
Thank you teacher, thank you so much

1475
01:09:11.637 --> 01:09:13.202
[Sunmi mocks crying]

1476
01:09:16.190 --> 01:09:18.121
[Sunmi’s crying sound]

1477
01:09:20.527 --> 01:09:21.925
[Sunmi mocks crying]
[Seonmibu’s sobbing sound]

1478
01:09:23.197 --> 01:09:25.328
(Sunmi) Stop crying
[Sunmi mocks crying]

1479
01:09:29.102 --> 01:09:30.366
Thank you for your hard work

1480
01:09:34.107 --> 01:09:35.342
[Sunmi’s wife sighs in relief]

1481
01:09:35.409 --> 01:09:36.439
[Sunmi mocks crying]

1482
01:09:37.811 --> 01:09:40.213
(Junmo) Because the ovarian lump is not in a good shape
I was worried

1483
01:09:40.280 --> 01:09:42.036
Both are B9 people

1484
01:09:42.103 --> 01:09:43.836
(Eunmi) I think the bleeding is okay too.

1485
01:09:43.903 --> 01:09:45.470
I'll finish it well, Professor.

1486
01:09:45.537 --> 01:09:46.444
(Junmo) Okay

1487
01:09:47.304 --> 01:09:48.918
Please count the gauze

1488
01:09:54.671 --> 01:09:57.960
(Dahye) It’s my first surgery tomorrow morning.
What should I do if I don’t get permission?

1489
01:09:58.027 --> 01:09:59.633
This is the most basic of basics.

1490
01:09:59.700 --> 01:10:01.003
(Nanjing) I’m sorry

1491
01:10:01.070 --> 01:10:03.003
I'll take it right now

1492
01:10:03.070 --> 01:10:04.271
(Dahye) Yes

1493
01:10:04.338 --> 01:10:05.268
[Call end tone]

1494
01:10:06.206 --> 01:10:07.437
[Mouse operation sound]

1495
01:10:09.510 --> 01:10:11.441
[Keyboard operation sound]
[eerie sound effect]

1496
01:10:12.312 --> 01:10:13.977
[creaking sound]

1497
01:10:19.999 --> 01:10:21.751
[creaking sound]
[Mouse operation sound]

1498
01:10:25.893 --> 01:10:27.290
[Keyboard operation sound]

1499
01:10:43.644 --> 01:10:44.845
[Ok-Im’s labored breathing]

1500
01:10:44.912 --> 01:10:46.442
[Calm music]

1501
01:10:55.789 --> 01:10:56.819
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1502
01:11:00.894 --> 01:11:02.592
[Sound of a ballpoint pen snapping]

1503
01:11:11.772 --> 01:11:13.155
[Sound of toilet flushing]

1504
01:11:18.508 --> 01:11:19.408
(Nanjing) Grandmother

1505
01:11:19.475 --> 01:11:21.243
(Okim) Oh my, you’re surprised.

1506
01:11:21.310 --> 01:11:22.582
[Calm music]
It's 9 o'clock

1507
01:11:22.649 --> 01:11:26.386
Oh my, our flower line is very classy.

1508
01:11:26.453 --> 01:11:28.384
- Are you ready?
